Significant modifications maintained in this fork include, among others:
- A built-in rhythm game: master chart generation from any local song,
  Easy/Normal/Hard chart derivation, latency calibration, scroll-speed and
  note-density controls, and play-logic presets
- AI-assisted song identification ("ask about a song"), song-title and lyric
  translation, and Japanese romaji reading support
- On-demand MusicBrainz metadata matching (recording, release, artist)
- In-app changelog, About screen with build info, and an in-app updater for
  GitHub releases
- Car/Bluetooth AVRCP and MediaSession improvements (e.g. placeholder lyrics
  for pure-music playback)
- Removal of F-Droid distribution channels and related update plumbing

